K8s Event 及诊断数据，Pod 虽然成功调度（PodScheduled=True），但在启动容器前必须挂载卷。由于目标 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 在命名空间 `aiops-case-03` 中不存在，Kubelet 的挂载操作失败（FailedMount）。这一阻塞机制导致容器无法完成初始化，从而使得 Pod 永远停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。证据 8 直接指出了缺失的资源对象，证据 1、2、5 和 6 提供了该状态持续存在的观测验证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 54.8s\n├─ 问题定位: 16.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 27.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 27.9s (Evidence 21.1s, RCA 6.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 54.752, "metrics": {"run_id": "8ecd3eb3caa8456c", "mttr": {"value": "54.8s", "seconds": 54.75697994232178, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分